      "voiceover_script": "Lumen Eats is a city food delivery startup about to launch lunchtime meals. One big risk: nobody wants them. Market research is the process of gathering, analysing and interpreting information about a market. On the map, empty order tickets float over office blocks. The team can ask customers directly, or read data someone else collected. This video follows two information streams, then builds a sample grid, and finally runs a survey with real numbers. Choose well, and a costly launch becomes a calculated one.",
