      "voiceover_script": "Fieldwork goes to the customer. Desk research stays at the screen. Fieldwork gives current, specific answers, but it costs time and money, and a poor sample can bias it. Desk research is faster and cheaper, yet data may be outdated or not specific to this city. Lumen Eats puts a clock beside each stream: days for fieldwork, minutes for desk work. A price tag appears beside each: thousands for surveys, almost nothing for a report. The right mix matters more than any single method.",
