      "voiceover_script": "Here is the full survey. The target population is eight thousand office workers. A random sample of four hundred replies. Two hundred and forty say they would order lunch, which is sixty percent. Ninety six prefer dinner, and sixty four are unsure. A quota check keeps the age mix even. The same question with loaded wording lifts support to seventy eight percent, a clear warning sign. A desk report costs two hundred dollars but is two years old; the survey costs one thousand two hundred and is current. Recommendation: trust the neutral survey.",
